  <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
      <span style="font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E5A524;display:block;margin-bottom:12px;">Per beroep</span>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,48px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#001F3F;margin:0 0 16px;">Het juiste pensioen voor jouw stiel</h2>
      <p style="font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#3F5767;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;">Met of zonder vennootschap, met of zonder personeel? Hieronder de aanpak per discipline.</p>
    </div>
